   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-10-24T02:06:10.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The Version 1.60 update to GBVSR was released on October 25. This update comes with the new playable character Vikala and additional in-game content such as stickers and illustrations included with Battle Pass Round 6.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Granblue Fantasy Versus: Rising – Vikala Gameplay Trailer",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Vikala, Guardian of the North, Joins the Roster as a Playable Character!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Vikala is now obtainable as a DLC character. This addition to the roster includes a Premium Avatar of her that can be set as a Partner Character to give you advice and support while playing, a character badge, and more!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Vikala (Voice: Hayden Daviau / Atsumi Tanezaki )",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As one of the Twelve Divine Generals, she has been entrusted to watch over and protect the Northern skies from evil and corruption. Despite being known for her positive and cheerful demeanor, once her headband comes off, she reverts to the shy, introverted girl she has always been inside. Ever at her side is Dormouse, her sentient mousetrap companion.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Character Costume and More Content Coming with Battle Pass Round 6",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "The latest battle pass, Battle Pass Round 6, includes additional in-game items that can be unlocked, such as character illustrations, music, badges, trophies, and more. A new lobby avatar, Yunicorn, can also be obtained as a battle pass reward.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Players can obtain even more rewards by purchasing the Premium Battle Pass Round 6 DLC, which includes a Spooky Vicky costume for Vikala in addition to exclusive character colors and weapon skins.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
